@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<section class="section">
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

    <p>When you use this website, SuryaSugam Bakery stores information you submit or select so it can process your requests. This includes cart items and quantities, submitted order details, custom-order contact and preference details, newsletter email addresses, and product comments. The site also records these submissions and cart changes in its local application database.</p>

    <p>A random browser identifier is stored in an essential, HTTP-only cookie to associate your cart and submissions with your browser. Product comments are visible to other visitors. When you submit an order or custom request, the site saves it first and then opens a prepared WhatsApp message to the bakery; WhatsApp is governed by its own privacy policy.</p>

    <p>Contact SuryaSugam Bakery through WhatsApp if you have questions about your information or want to request its removal. Do not submit sensitive personal information in order notes or comments.</p>
</section>
